  "title": "Airbnb.org commits additional $1M for emergency housing during Los Angeles warehouse fire cleanup",
  "summary": "Airbnb.org, a nonprofit founded by Airbnb to provide emergency housing in times of crisis, is working with 211 LA, a nonprofit serving as LA County’s 24/7 information and referral service provider, to expand free, emergency housing resources to residents who will be evacuated amid ongoing cleanup efforts after a warehouse fire in Los Angeles.",
